---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="Summer Childcare Solutions | Marietta Childcare"
  description="Explore Marietta Childcare's summer programs with full-day care, enrichment activities, and field trips.">
  <section class="relative py-32 overflow-hidden w-screen -ml-[calc((100vw-100%)/2)]">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 z-0">
      <img 
        src="/images/Background_Images/child_swinging_playground_low_angle_background.jpg" 
        alt="Summer childcare" 
        class="w-full h-full object-cover"
      />
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-black/40"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="relative z-10 max-w-[1280px] mx-auto px-6 lg:px-20">
      <h1 class="text-4xl lg:text-6xl font-black mb-6 text-white drop-shadow-lg">Summer Childcare Solutions</h1>
      <p class="text-lg mb-12 max-w-2xl text-white drop-shadow-md">Full-day summer programs with enrichment activities, field trips, and engaging learning experiences.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-20 px-6 lg:px-20">
    <div class="max-w-[1280px] mx-auto">
      <article class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
        <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">Summer Childcare Solutions at Marietta Childcare</h1>
        
        <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 mb-8">Marietta Childcare provides comprehensive summer childcare solutions. Marietta Childcare's summer programs keep children engaged, active, and learning during school breaks.</p>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Full-Day Summer Programs</h2>
          <p>Marietta Childcare offers full-day summer programs for school-age children. Summer programs at Marietta Childcare operate during school breaks and summer months. Marietta Childcare's full-day programming provides comprehensive care and activities.</p>
          <p>Marietta Childcare's summer programs accommodate working parents' schedules. Full-day care at Marietta Childcare eliminates childcare gaps during summer. Marietta Childcare's summer solution supports parent work continuity.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Enrichment Activities and Field Trips</h2>
          <p>Marietta Childcare provides enrichment activities throughout the summer. Summer activities at Marietta Childcare include arts, crafts, sports, and games. Marietta Childcare's enrichment programming keeps children engaged and entertained.</p>
          <p>Marietta Childcare organizes field trips during summer camp. Field trips at Marietta Childcare include local attractions and educational destinations. Marietta Childcare's summer experiences create lasting memories and learning opportunities.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Themed Programming</h2>
          <p>Marietta Childcare organizes themed summer programming. Themed weeks at Marietta Childcare include science, nature, history, and cultural themes. Marietta Childcare's themed approach makes summer learning engaging and fun.</p>
          <p>Marietta Childcare's themes rotate throughout the summer. Themed activities at Marietta Childcare include crafts, games, and educational experiences. Marietta Childcare's programming supports children's curiosity and learning.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Outdoor Activities and Water Play</h2>
          <p>Marietta Childcare emphasizes outdoor activities during summer. Outdoor programming at Marietta Childcare includes sports, games, and nature exploration. Marietta Childcare's outdoor activities support physical development and fitness.</p>
          <p>Marietta Childcare includes water play and splash activities during summer. Water activities at Marietta Childcare provide cooling relief and fun. Marietta Childcare's outdoor approach makes summer enjoyable and active.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Flexible Summer Enrollment</h2>
          <p>Marietta Childcare offers flexible summer enrollment options. Summer enrollment at Marietta Childcare accommodates various family schedules. Marietta Childcare's flexibility allows families to enroll for specific weeks or the entire summer.</p>
          <p>Marietta Childcare's flexible approach supports families with changing summer plans. Enrollment at Marietta Childcare can be adjusted based on family needs. Marietta Childcare's flexibility makes summer care accessible.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Summer Registration and Timing</h2>
          <p>Marietta Childcare begins summer camp registration in March for currently enrolled students. Summer registration at Marietta Childcare opens in April for the general public. Marietta Childcare's registration timeline allows families to plan ahead.</p>
          <p>Summer camp start and end dates at Marietta Childcare vary by location. Families should speak with the Marietta center director for specific summer dates. Marietta Childcare's summer schedule aligns with school calendars.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Tuition and Payment Options</h2>
          <p>Marietta Childcare requires weekly tuition to hold your child's spot in summer camp. Summer tuition at Marietta Childcare is paid weekly even if your child does not attend every week. Marietta Childcare's payment model ensures your child's enrollment.</p>
          <p>Marietta Childcare offers flexible payment options for summer programs. Payment at Marietta Childcare can be arranged to accommodate family budgets. Marietta Childcare's payment flexibility supports summer enrollment.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Withdrawal and Re-enrollment</h2>
          <p>Families can withdraw from summer camp without penalty. Withdrawal from Marietta Childcare's summer program does not require tuition payment. Marietta Childcare's flexible withdrawal policy accommodates changing plans.</p>
          <p>Families withdrawing during summer can re-enroll in the fall. Re-enrollment at Marietta Childcare is available for families who withdraw during summer. Marietta Childcare's flexible approach supports family planning.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="bg-blue-50 p-6 rounded-lg mb-12">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Plan Your Summer</h3>
          <p class="mb-4">Marietta Childcare welcomes families to explore summer camp options. Contact Marietta Childcare to learn about summer programs and register for camp.</p>
          <a href="/contact" class="inline-block bg-blue-600 text-white px-6 py-3 rounded-lg font-semibold hover:bg-blue-700 transition">Contact Us</a>
        </section>

        <nav class="mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-gray-200">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">Related Pages</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-2">
            <li><a href="/faq/hours-and-schedule" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800">What Are Your Hours?</a></li>
            <li><a href="/solutions/working-parents" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800">Solutions for Working Parents</a></li>
            <li><a href="/programs" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800">Our Programs</a></li>
            <li><a href="/faq/how-much-childcare-cost" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800">How Much Does Childcare Cost?</a></li>
            <li><a href="/contact" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800">Contact Marietta Childcare</a></li>
          </ul>
        </nav>
      </article>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
